<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Rothschild moves gold market-making to Sydney.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Rothschild moves gold market-making to Sydney.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore gold and silver market making desk of N.M. Rothschild and Sons Ltd has been transferred to Sydney in a move to centralise operations, senior Rothschild  gold dealer Mark Freemantle said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Singapore will continue to trade in the physical gold and silver markets,&quot; Freemantle told Reuters.</p>
<p>The shift centralises Rothschilds market-making activies in gold and silver in Sydney and London, enabling the the company to take better advantage of different time zones, he said.</p>
<p>The moved involved a single dealer, although there are plans to increase the number of dealers in Sydney, he said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
